Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Macondo (github.com/domino14/macondo), GPL-3.0, Copyright César Del Solar and contributors.
  Game rules, move validation, scoring, game history and the computer opponents. Linked as a Go
  module. The files in data/letterdistributions and data/strategy are copied from Macondo.

word-golib (github.com/domino14/word-golib), GPL-3.0, Copyright César Del Solar and contributors.
  Word graph (KWG) and tile mapping support.

Woogles.io / liwords (github.com/woogles-io/liwords), AGPL-3.0, Copyright Woogles.io contributors.
  The visual design (color palettes, board and tile styles, theme names such as Balsa, Forest and
  Pastel) is modelled on liwords' stylesheets. The word lists are downloaded at runtime from the
  liwords repository; they are not included here.

